WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Not sure what something does? Point at it: the hint bar, top left, says what it is.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
The first time you open a window like the Mixer, a tip shows, just once.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.600
Got it closes it, No more tips turns them off. How to use this opens a guide.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.600
A short guide: what the window is for, the first steps, and its video.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.600
Every main window's menu ends with How to use this, and Help lists them all.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.600
Press the question mark key: the palette finds commands, menus, and now every setting.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.600
Pick one: Settings opens on its page, with the option outlined.
